              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword, light armour and shield. Army Standard Bearer and Roman Army Standard rules - see page 119 of the WAB rulebook. 0-1. (Spartacus p.16)</characteristic>
