            <profile id="5baf-cb2e-6339-be80" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="eb14-e889-c793-0fc4" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword, light armour and large shield. A Centurion may only replace the leader model (and that model is discarded) in a unit of Legionaries and he may not leave the unit once assigned to it unless killed. If the unit is destroyed and the Centurion remains, he can then act as a normal independent character. (Spartacus p.16)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="0fd8-0c5e-7796-2357" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
