              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Pilum, sword, light armour and large shield. One unit may be raised to Veteran status with their WS and BS increased to 4 (+2 pts). Drilled. Stubborn. Up to 25% of the army may be Experienced Legionaries. (Spartacus p.16)</characteristic>
