              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Each machine has a two or three man crew armed with swords. Bolt Thrower - see WAB rulebook: range 36", Strength 4/-1 per rank, no save, D3 wounds per hit. The crew may have light armour (+2 pts). One Scorpion per 1,000 points (counted in the Auxiliaries &amp; Support allowance). (Spartacus p.17)</characteristic>
