            <profile id="c985-65b1-213f-6eee" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="eb14-e889-c793-0fc4" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword and javelin or sling. May have light armour (+2 pts), buckler or shield (+1 pt). May exchange javelin or sling for composite bow (+1 pt). Light Infantry. Sling &amp; bow armed troops are skirmishers. (Spartacus p.17)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="81f3-68ab-40f9-9025" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
