              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Mixed weapons and buckler. Skirmishers. Feigned Flight: if the unit chooses to flee or fire &amp; flee as a charge reaction, they rally immediately at the end of their move, facing in any direction; the charging enemy encountering them does not destroy them and the unit may instead fight in the Close Combat phase; their opponents still count as charging. (Spartacus p.17)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="75ab-d9d1-44c5-f337" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Save" typeId="603e-2898-6af9-6cf1">5+</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="With conditional bonuses" typeId="5882-dd5a-bc28-4024">-</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="d5e4-804e-6192-0114">Armour save from armour, shield and barding bonus pips (rulebook pp.95-98); maximum 3+ (2+ for barded cavalry). M already includes encumbrance for armour/barding (p.96). Conditional pips are in the next column.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
              <!-- armour-save -->
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink id="418a-5955-fa9b-0ba1" name="Skirmishers (Spartacus)" hidden="false" targetId="06df-a9d4-2df7-c18c" type="rule"/>
