              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Mixed weapons and buckler. May have shield (+1 pt). May have throwing spear (+2 pts). One unit may have light armour (+2 pts). Light Cavalry. Warband. (Spartacus p.17)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
